cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below. It began as a blog list of penetration testing companies by Ahmad Abdur Rehman in 2023."
title: "Cybersecurity and information security companies in Norway"
abstract: >-
  A verified, community-maintained directory of companies that sell cybersecurity
  and information security work to customers in Norway: penetration testing, red
  teaming and security assessment, SOC and incident response, cloud and OT
  security, identity, forensics, governance, privacy and training. Each entry
  records whether the provider has a registered Norwegian presence, how the
  Norwegian work is delivered and whether that is in-house or resold, the
  in-house security staff count with the basis for the claim (published,
  attested, estimated or a researcher crowd), the capability tags the company
  publishes, its Norwegian organisasjonsnummer, and the sources behind every
  figure. Started in 2023 by Ahmad Abdur Rehman as a list of penetration testing
  companies and widened in 2026.
